# UI Design System

## Design Philosophy

The Sales Intelligence Platform UI should be:

- Professional and sleek
- Excel-like for data display
- Interactive with subtle animations
- Clean and minimal
- Focused on data and functionality

## Color Palette

### Approved Colors

**Primary Colors**:

- Neutral Gray: `#2D3748` (dark text)
- Soft Gray: `#E2E8F0` (backgrounds)
- White: `#FFFFFF`
- Off-white: `#F7FAFC`

**Accent Colors**:

- Blue: `#3182CE` (primary actions)
- Teal: `#319795` (success states)
- Orange: `#DD6B20` (warnings)
- Red: `#E53E3E` (errors)

**Text Colors**:

- Primary: `#1A202C`
- Secondary: `#4A5568`
- Tertiary: `#718096`
- Disabled: `#A0AEC0`

### Restricted Colors

Do NOT use:

- Purple or Indigo
- Lime or bright green
- Cyan or bright blue
- Neon or fluorescent colors
- High saturation colors

## Typography

### Font Families

```css
--font-primary: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
--font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", "Fira Code", monospace;
```

### Font Sizes

```css
--text-xs: 0.75rem; /* 12px */
--text-sm: 0.875rem; /* 14px */
--text-base: 1rem; /* 16px */
--text-lg: 1.125rem; /* 18px */
--text-xl: 1.25rem; /* 20px */
--text-2xl: 1.5rem; /* 24px */
--text-3xl: 1.875rem; /* 30px */
```

### Font Weights

```css
--font-normal: 400;
--font-medium: 500;
--font-semibold: 600;
--font-bold: 700;
```

## Spacing System

```css
--spacing-1: 0.25rem; /* 4px */
--spacing-2: 0.5rem; /* 8px */
--spacing-3: 0.75rem; /* 12px */
--spacing-4: 1rem; /* 16px */
--spacing-5: 1.25rem; /* 20px */
--spacing-6: 1.5rem; /* 24px */
--spacing-8: 2rem; /* 32px */
--spacing-10: 2.5rem; /* 40px */
--spacing-12: 3rem; /* 48px */
```

## Component Design Standards

### Search Bar Component

**Design**:

- Large, prominent input field
- Clear placeholder text
- File upload button integrated
- Loading indicator
- Auto-complete suggestions

**Specifications**:

```
Height: 56px
Border: 1px solid #E2E8F0
Border Radius: 8px
Focus Border: 2px solid #3182CE
Padding: 16px 20px
Font Size: 16px
```

**Features**:

- File drag and drop zone
- Real-time file type detection
- Upload progress indicator
- Clear file button

### Data Table Component (Excel-like)

**Design**:

- Fixed header row
- Alternating row colors
- Hover state on rows
- Sortable columns
- Resizable columns
- Inline editing capability
- Row selection

**Specifications**:

```
Header Height: 40px
Row Height: 36px
Header Background: #F7FAFC
Header Text: #2D3748, font-weight: 600
Row Odd: #FFFFFF
Row Even: #F7FAFC
Row Hover: #EDF2F7
Border: 1px solid #E2E8F0
```

**Column Types**:

- Text: Left aligned
- Number: Right aligned
- Date: Center aligned
- Email: Left aligned with icon
- Link: Underlined on hover

**Interactions**:

- Click header to sort
- Double-click cell to edit
- Drag column border to resize
- Shift+Click for multi-select
- Right-click for context menu

### Agent Activity Display

**Design**:

- Collapsible panel
- Real-time status updates
- Progress indicators
- Step-by-step breakdown
- Subtle animations

**Specifications**:

```
Panel Width: 300px (sidebar)
Background: #F7FAFC
Border: 1px solid #E2E8F0
Border Radius: 8px
Padding: 16px
```

**Status Indicators**:

- Analyzing: Blue pulse animation
- Executing: Blue progress bar
- Validating: Teal progress bar
- Completed: Teal checkmark
- Failed: Red X icon

### Login Page

**Design**:

- Clean, minimal layout
- Center-aligned form
- Subtle gradient background
- Clear error messages
- Remember me option

**Layout**:

```
Container Width: 400px
Form Background: #FFFFFF
Box Shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)
Border Radius: 12px
Padding: 40px
```

**Elements**:

- Logo at top
- Email input
- Password input (with show/hide toggle)
- Remember me checkbox
- Login button (full width)
- Forgot password link
- Sign up link

### Button Styles

**Primary Button**:

```css
background: #3182ce;
color: #ffffff;
border: none;
border-radius: 6px;
padding: 10px 20px;
font-weight: 500;
transition: all 0.2s;

&:hover {
  background: #2c5282;
}
```

**Secondary Button**:

```css
background: transparent;
color: #3182ce;
border: 1px solid #3182ce;
border-radius: 6px;
padding: 10px 20px;
font-weight: 500;

&:hover {
  background: #ebf8ff;
}
```

**Danger Button**:

```css
background: #e53e3e;
color: #ffffff;
border: none;
border-radius: 6px;
padding: 10px 20px;
font-weight: 500;

&:hover {
  background: #c53030;
}
```

### Input Fields

**Standard Input**:

```css
border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
border-radius: 6px;
padding: 10px 12px;
font-size: 14px;
color: #2d3748;
background: #ffffff;

&:focus {
  border-color: #3182ce;
  outline: none;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(49, 130, 206, 0.1);
}

&:disabled {
  background: #f7fafc;
  color: #a0aec0;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}
```

### Modal/Dialog

**Design**:

```css
background: #ffffff;
border-radius: 12px;
box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
max-width: 600px;
padding: 24px;

overlay {
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
}
```

### Loading States

**Spinner**:

```css
border: 3px solid #e2e8f0;
border-top-color: #3182ce;
border-radius: 50%;
width: 24px;
height: 24px;
animation: spin 0.6s linear infinite;
```

**Skeleton Loading**:

```css
background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f7fafc 0%, #e2e8f0 50%, #f7fafc 100%);
background-size: 200% 100%;
animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;
border-radius: 4px;
```

### Toast Notifications

**Success**:

```css
background: #319795;
color: #ffffff;
border-left: 4px solid #2c7a7b;
```

**Error**:

```css
background: #e53e3e;
color: #ffffff;
border-left: 4px solid #c53030;
```

**Warning**:

```css
background: #dd6b20;
color: #ffffff;
border-left: 4px solid #c05621;
```

**Info**:

```css
background: #3182ce;
color: #ffffff;
border-left: 4px solid #2c5282;
```

## Layout Structure

### Main Application Layout

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Header (Logo, User Menu)                  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                             │
│  Search Bar (center, prominent)            │
│                                             │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                       ┌─────┤
│                                       │Agent│
│  Data Table (Excel-like)              │Panel│
│                                       │     │
│                                       │     │
│                                       └─────┤
├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Pagination / Export Controls              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Animation Guidelines

### Subtle Transitions

```css
transition-duration: 0.2s;
transition-timing-function: ease-in-out;
```

### Hover Effects

```css
&:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}
```

### Loading Animations

```css
@keyframes pulse {
  0%,
  100% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  50% {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
}

@keyframes spin {
  from {
    transform: rotate(0deg);
  }
  to {
    transform: rotate(360deg);
  }
}

@keyframes shimmer {
  0% {
    background-position: -200% 0;
  }
  100% {
    background-position: 200% 0;
  }
}
```

## Responsive Design

### Breakpoints

```css
--mobile: 640px;
--tablet: 768px;
--desktop: 1024px;
--wide: 1280px;
```

### Mobile Adaptations

- Stack components vertically
- Hide agent panel (show on tap)
- Simplify data table (card view)
- Larger touch targets (44px minimum)
- Bottom sheet for filters

## Accessibility

### Standards

- WCAG 2.1 Level AA compliance
- Keyboard navigation support
- Screen reader compatibility
- Focus visible indicators
- Sufficient color contrast (4.5:1 minimum)

### Implementation

```typescript
// Proper semantic HTML
<button aria-label="Search" role="button">
  Search
</button>

// Keyboard navigation
onKeyDown={(e) => {
  if (e.key === 'Enter') handleSubmit();
}}

// Focus management
const firstInputRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);
useEffect(() => {
  firstInputRef.current?.focus();
}, []);
```

## Icon System

**Icon Library**: Lucide React or Heroicons

**Usage**:

- 16px for inline icons
- 20px for buttons
- 24px for prominent actions
- Consistent stroke width: 2px

## Data Visualization

When displaying statistics or metrics:

- Use simple bar charts
- Subtle gradients acceptable
- Clear labels and axes
- Tooltip on hover
- Accessible color combinations
